across social media.

648
00:37:43.565 --> 00:37:45.785
To help fill in pieces of
the puzzle here

649
00:37:45.828 --> 00:37:47.917
is USCN's own
Jean Treblis. Jean?

650
00:37:47.961 --> 00:37:49.919
Well Harper, It's kind
of early to say,

651
00:37:49.963 --> 00:37:51.921
but it looks like that
what's happening is--

652
00:37:51.965 --> 00:37:54.402
--Some of the concerns about how
Justice Oliver Straight tried

653
00:37:54.446 --> 00:37:56.448
