your own rulings.

885
00:47:19.271 --> 00:47:21.664
And that might make
it a courtroom.

886
00:47:21.708 --> 00:47:26.452
You said there were 70,000
people right now?

887
00:47:26.495 --> 00:47:28.410
And more every second?

888
00:47:28.454 --> 00:47:32.501
Well, it would seem to me that
whatever you're trying to prove

889
00:47:32.545 --> 00:47:37.550
would be in jeopardy if you
do not follow your own rules.

890
00:47:45.166 --> 00:47:47.081
Go ahead.

891
00:47:47.125 --> 00:47:48.691
I beg your pardon?

892
00:47:48.735 --> 00:47:50.128
I objected.
My objection was overruled.

893
00:47:50.171 --> 00:47:51.912
So go ahead. You said conflict
of interest.

894
00:47:51.956 --> 00:47:54.393
What-What conflict
of interest?

895
00:47:54.436 --> 00:47:57.135
Well, you made a speech
to that camera,

896
00:47:57.178 --> 00:48:01.269
and you did it eloquently,
very well.

897
00:48:01.313 --> 00:48:03.837
The girl came from an
ethnic community.

898
00:48:03.881 --> 00:48:05.273
Some of their names

899
00:48:05.317 --> 00:48:09.408
were extremely difficult
to pronounce.

900
00:48:09.451 --> 00:48:12.411
But you said them
with ease.

901
00:48:12.454 --> 00:48:14.804
There's also the issue
of the dog's name.

902
00:48:14.848 --> 00:48:16.328
Every news piece
mentioned the dog.

903
00:48:16.371 --> 00:48:17.590
And the name?

904
00:48:17.633 --> 00:48:18.808
And the dog's name.

905
00:48:18.852 --> 00:48:20.898
But not the breed. I know that.

906
00:48:20.941 --> 00:48:22.638
Because that was one
of the hold-backs

907
00:48:22.682 --> 00:48:25.859
the police for suspect
identification.

908
00:48:25.903 --> 00:48:29.384
Certainly it seems that you
know the Jeeter family well.

909
00:48:29.428 --> 00:48:30.908
You do, don't you?

910
00:48:31.996 --> 00:48:33.432
Who are you?

911
00:48:36.652 --> 00:48:44.182
♪

912
00:48:51.058 --> 00:48:53.060
I was her uncle.

913
00:48:55.019 --> 00:48:59.023
♪

914
00:48:59.066 --> 00:49:04.071
[indistinct chatter]

915
00:49:05.812 --> 00:49:08.771
News Anchor: This is a USCN
