923
00:49:23.961 --> 00:49:26.659
Here to help us sort
through the details

924
00:49:26.702 --> 00:49:29.575
is USCN analyst
Josh Harkridge. Josh?

925
00:49:29.618 --> 00:49:32.665
What we now know is the man
holding Judge Straight hostage

926
00:49:32.708 --> 00:49:36.451
